{"kind":"stack","id":"stk-shadows","title":"Shadows: light being blocked","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#073642","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Light source"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Something that gives out its own light, such as the sun, a torch or a lamp."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Opaque object"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"An object that light cannot pass through, so it blocks the light and makes a shadow."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What makes a shadow?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Light being blocked by an opaque object","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Light being made by the object","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Light bending around a clear glass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which one is the light source?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"The sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"The moon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"A tree","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which material would make the darkest shadow?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"A wooden block","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"A clear plastic sheet","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"A sheet of tracing paper","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You are walking home on a sunny day. Your shadow stretches long behind you. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Stand still and watch your shadow","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Hold a book up to block the sun","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You notice your shadow moves as you move. The sun is still shining on you from one side."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"The book blocks the sun, and a dark shadow falls on the path behind it."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Why does a shadow appear on the ground behind a child standing in the sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Their body blocks the light from the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"The ground makes its own dark light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"The sun turns off for a moment","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Which is the best way to make a shadow bigger?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Move the object closer to the light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Move the object further from the light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"Shine the light through a window","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done! You have learned about shadows."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Shadows form when an opaque object blocks light from a light source. Keep looking for shadows around you."}],"actions":[]}}
